# Compose-supplied runtime vars propagated to SSH login shells via
# /etc/environment (regenerated by entrypoint stage 60 on every boot).
# One variable NAME per line; empty values are skipped at render time.
# SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the passthrough allowlist — adding an env
# var to docker-compose.yaml `environment:` is only visible to SSH
# sessions if it is also listed here.
#
# DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED (do NOT add):
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  overrides the persisted `claude login` OAuth
#   GH_TOKEN           overrides the persisted `gh auth login`
#
# Secrets below stay listed because MCP server fragments under
# config/mcp-servers.d/ reference them as ${VAR} placeholders expanded
# from the shell env at MCP-spawn time.
TZ
GIT_USER_NAME
GIT_USER_EMAIL
NODE_OPTIONS
NOTIFY_URLS
EXA_API_KEY
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN
COOLIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN
COOLIFY_BASE_URL
NUGET_REGISTRY_USER
NUGET_REGISTRY_TOKEN
